     "justification": "The gate at the closeout, the commit built from the judged tree, the index copy that lets the judged-tree check see a rewrite made in the second the index was written, the frozen attempt files, the governing changed row and the honest preview each close one way in which a closeout could publish a leaf's memory unjudged or let its judgment be replaced; none of them gives the guarantee alone."
